{"title":"机遇与挑战—PPP+BIM","date":"2017-07-05","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 28.5pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#191919;\r\nmso-font-kerning:18.0pt\">机遇与挑战&mdash;<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP+BIM<o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 28.5pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:#191919;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#191919\">我国工程造价咨询产业从<span lang=\"EN-US\">1996</span>年起至今已经走过了<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>年历程。<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>年来，适应社会主义市场经济体制的工程造价咨询产业顺利发展并安然度过了加入<span lang=\"EN-US\">WTO</span>、计价模式变革等挑战。但是，造价咨询业产值不断扩大的同时，利润却日益稀薄<span lang=\"EN-US\">......<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#191919\">随着<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPP</span>模式、<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术、营改增制度、全费用综合单价、全新清单计价规范、总承包与建筑产业化等相继出台或陆续推出，整个建筑行业或固定资产投资领域面临巨大变革，这也给工程造价咨询产业带来前所未有的机遇与挑战。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#191919\">那么，我们该如何把握？</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#191919\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div>\r\n\t&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n\t<article class=\"yead_editor yead-selected\" data-author=\"Wxeditor\" style=\"margin: 5px auto; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; white-space: normal; border: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin: 5px 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 32px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: inline-block; float: left; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: inherit; border-color: rgb(226, 86, 27); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 45px; color: rgb(226, 86, 27); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong class